{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51339","headline":"自咎 · 权德舆","name":"自咎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自咎咎何穷，飘然荜户中。\n清时名未立，稔岁室犹空。\n幽独惭芳桂，飞鸣羡早鸿。\n出门何所见，歏息向秋风。\n（以上《四部丛刊》影印大兴氏刊本《权载之文集》一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}